  ('25ceed0c-b82e-48a2-8718-e83f6e4106f9', 4, null, 'Add the collards and water and toss. Cook uncovered, stirring, until tender but still bright green, 5–7 minutes. Season with pepper and serve with ugali, rice or grilled meat.', 360, null, null);

